## How the lesson runs (85 min)
| Time | Segment |
|---|---|
| 0:00–0:05 | Setup, prediction |
| 0:05–0:15 | Human diffusion: warm run, cold run |
| 0:15–0:25 | Copy the data, graph it, Q1–Q4 |
| 0:25–0:39 | Human osmosis: Run A, Run B |
| 0:39–0:48 | Q5–Q8 |
| 0:48–0:56 | Tonicity body vote |
| 0:56–0:58 | Homework |
| 0:58–1:20 | Project launch: gallery walk of 7 real-data graphs, teams pick a question |
| 1:20–1:25 | Exit ticket |

